{"id": "69029", "title": "爱比死更难", "author": "三月微草", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 19, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69029.htm", "intro": "他向后靠坐在沙发上，吐一口烟雾，姿势慵懒却充满危险的气息，让徐依可觉得自己就如这世上最渺小的生物，或许在他眼里自己连人都算不上。他斜睨她，嘴角有一丝不易察觉的冷笑：“听说你站在门口几天几夜就为了见我一面，对我热情的女人不少，但像你这么热情的还真少见！”她低低的道：“我求你！”他嗤笑一声：“徐小姐，连路边卖菜的大婶都知道求人提一篮子鸡蛋去，你今天就用这副出殡的表情来求我？”“你要什么？”“你最珍贵的是什么？”她跪下去：“我的自尊！”\r\n豪门情深 缘浅虐恋", "base": "files/article/html/69/69029", "chapters": [{"title": "1-8", "file": "10555233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-18", "file": "10555234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-25", "file": "10555235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-32", "file": "10555236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-39", "file": "10555237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-43", "file": "10555238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10555239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10555240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10555241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-21", "file": "10555242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10555243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10555244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10555245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10555246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-24", "file": "10555247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10555248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-11", "file": "10555249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-17", "file": "10555250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结+番外", "file": "10555251.html", "available": false}]}